# Hatari measurement harness: one directory per configuration, each holding an
# 8.3-named .TOS, its .lod and the run's dumps plus emulator/debugger logs.
# Machine-local and large; every figure it produced is reproducible from the
# commands recorded in OPTIMIZATION.md.
